Two weapon is one of the most powerful features in the
game.  It beats any AC boost you could get from a
shield to the only shield worth it once you've built skill
in two weapon is reflection.  Get reflection from some
other source and there isn't a shield worth the difference.
But two weapon is a feature to be used in the mid game.
It takes building up the underlying skills first before
using it and that can mean descending to mines end
using a shield and climbing back out of the mines
starting to practice two weapon.  For the later game a
silver saber is likely the best preparation, either as your
artifact or as the secondary wield.


